\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/ac/Font_TeamMeat_b.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060349\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"a\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat a.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_a.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/30/Font_TeamMeat_a.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060324\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"g\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat g.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_g.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1f/Font_TeamMeat_g.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060550\" /></span></span></span></div></div></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity Image</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Entity image\"><img alt=\"Entity image\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"177\" height=\"141\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gasbag.png\" data-image-key=\"Gasbag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/30/Gasbag.png/revision/latest?cb=20210824124256\" /></span></span></div></div><br /></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-smart-group pi-border-color\">\n    \n        <section class=\"pi-smart-group-head pi-border-color\">\n            \n                <h3 class=\"pi-smart-data-label pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"base hp\">Base HP</h3>\n            \n                <h3 class=\"pi-smart-data-label pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\">Stage HP</h3>\n            \n        </section>\n    \n    <section class=\"pi-smart-group-body pi-border-color\">\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"base hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">80</span></div></div></div>\n        \n            <div class=\"pi-smart-data-value pi-data-value pi-font pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" style=\"width: calc(1 / 2 * 100%);\" data-source=\"stage hp\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">0</span></div></div></div>\n        \n    </section>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><code>856.0</code></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"environment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Found In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Corpse\" title=\"Corpse\"><img alt=\"Stage Corpse icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Corpse icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Corpse_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/30/Stage_Corpse_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825172440\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div id=\"context-page\" class=\"context-box\"><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span> </div>\n<p><b>Gasbags</b> are a unique enemy type found only in <span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Corpse\" title=\"Corpse\"><img alt=\"Corpse\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Corpse icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Corpse_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/30/Stage_Corpse_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210825172440\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Corpse\" title=\"Corpse\">Corpse</a>. While they are alive, they emit a ring of toxic gas that deals damage to Isaac if he stands in it for too long. Additionally, Gasbags will occasionally spawn a chain of 4 &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fly#Army_Fly\" title=\"Fly\"><img alt=\"Army Fly\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Army Fly.png\" data-image-key=\"Army_Fly.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/e/ea/Army_Fly.png/revision/latest?cb=20210407203646\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fly#Army_Fly\" title=\"Fly\">Army Flies</a> to chase Isaac. Gasbags will only spawn flies if there are less than 8 army flies in the room, no matter how many Gasbags there are. The Gasbag's toxic cloud disappears a short time after it dies.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"https://antibirth.fandom.com/wiki/Gasbag\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"anti:Gasbag\">Gasbag</a> first appeared in the <i>Antibirth</i> mod where it acted identical but could not spawn flies.</li></ul>\n<p><br class=\"content-filter-end\" /></p><div class=\"nav-start\" style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n<table class=\"nav-box nav-main\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"nav-title\"><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821194340\" /></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Binding_of_Isaac:_Rebirth_Wiki\" title=\"Binding of Isaac: Rebirth Wiki\">The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth</a><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" w